{"id":"vod_sn_35655","vodId":"35655","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"真·恋姬无双","name_cn":"真·恋姬无双","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a2fae3412d3762cb8786a68ec8ebfd9b.jpg"},"summary":"BaseSon社的GALGAME《真・恋姫†无双～乙女缭乱☆三国志演义～》作为前作《恋姫†无双》的续篇，大量增加可攻略可推倒的女性角色到50名之多，原本只有蜀线的剧情也增加到了魏蜀吴三国皆可选择的情况。结果大受欢迎，游戏明明是在08年12月26日发售，却在08年GALGAME销量排行榜上占据第三位，可见其人气之高。游戏有了超人气续篇之后，动画版《恋姫†无双》也闻风而动，早早的在官网的FLASH中放出了只在《真・恋姫†无双～乙女缭乱☆三国志演义～》中才登场的刘备“2009 coming soon…”的图片，第二期的意向路人皆知。在宣布OVA化后，这次真真正正的第二季情报终于到来了，虽然具体时间尚未确定，不过基本可以肯定将在年内开播，喜欢三国的朋友们切勿错过。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:36:33","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zsx9Ltkwgn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MspXnhX5Tq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/66D3zpbfqW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Cxth4jcnri1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uLegh8Hk3E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pimJ7X235T1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LWEgUfMRB71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wPZqYAjKg21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wyRjp5vQkn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8dkzgZ3y7A1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/U0fpT1vUx81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/y9TBXZazXJ1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:32.193Z"}